doctype html
html
    head
        meta(charset="UTF-8")
        title Reset Your Password - Foodij
    body
        h1 Reset Your Password
        p Hello,
        p We received a request to reset your password for your Foodij account. Click the link below to reset your password:
        p(style="text-align: center; margin-top: 20px;")
            a(href=resetLink, style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #007BFF; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px;") Reset Your Password
        p If you did not request a password reset, please ignore this email or contact support if you have concerns.
        p Thank you,
        p The Foodij Team